 (_options.LengthFieldLength != 1 && _options.LengthFieldLength != 2 && _options.LengthFieldLength != 4)","score":0.0},"vector":[0.09878169,0.10534148,0.16898261,0.14980924,0.064970985,0.055368576,0.023598162,0.13140714,0.069632135,0.060877524,0.036166336,0.080268726,0.1569129,0.1267279,0.11578577,0.31912073,0.10413694,0.07690004,0.21702686,0.12152698,0.12557915,0.08042935,0.12241414,0.05570488,0.19103932,0.08286636,0.14477174,0.15677647,0.10239102,0.055927813,0.071765624,0.06860136,0.14259522,0.23207045,0.16705047,0.08211619,0.06615342,0.06654321,0.09111318,0.055945713,0.13460295,0.116725706,0.14575051,0.12390676,0.12007627,0.083060496,0.20203865,0.14194347,0.08048018,0.109524034,0.08081771,0.11427635,0.14100362,0.10454551,0.16712438,0.093290836,0.07183236,0.031192185,0.14342056,0.11370198,0.18705417,0.13664077,0.1123994,0.09137252]},{"chunk":{"file_path":"src\\Kable.Core\\Codecs\\LengthFieldCodec.cs","chunk_index":179,"start_line":76,"end_line":90,"content":"        {\n            throw new ArgumentOutOfRangeException(nameof(options), \"LengthFieldLength must be 1, 2, or 4 bytes.\");\n        }\n        if (_options.LengthFieldOffset < 0)\n        {\n            throw new ArgumentOutOfRangeException(nameof(options), \"LengthFieldOffset must be non-negative.\");\n        }\n    }\n\n    public bool TryDecode(ref ReadOnlySequence<byte> buffer, out TMessage message)\n    {\n        while (true)\n        {\n            if (buffer.IsEmpty)\n            {","score":0.0},"vector":[0.0,0.10403559,0.29933098,0.0,0.08319259,0.0,0.21292646,0.0,0.20146191,0.0,0.23281868,0.08949505,0.028797433,0.22578594,0.0,0.11557441,0.28372413,0.07843873,0.0,0.0,0.0,0.0,0.10642372,0.0,0.0,0.0,0.24724829,0.0,0.051636774,0.0,0.0,0.06859176,0.05546172,0.24781601,0.0,0.0,0.16885768,0.026740473,0.11534539,0.1868268,0.0,0.032553617,0.13447076,0.22651263,0.0,0.0,0.0,0.09841506,0.0,0.052542686,0.0,0.0,0.23069078,0.34400633,0.10590024,0.1069619,0.09661075,0.03056054,0.0,0.2609234,0.051636774,0.063721