4,0.016752567,0.14023368,0.21790878,0.03552717,0.028839504,0.02329856,0.20821886,0.055580307,0.08011441,0.013028092,0.1117702,0.03345958,0.06392596,0.013054181,0.12118031,0.07905726,0.084750354,0.008178949,0.06991061,0.16544303,0.07778845,0.08266582,0.046360478,0.2103398,0.026294516,0.17853239,0.09732039,0.16092712,0.0921698,0.070226945,0.11762477,0.16578043,0.11326017,0.027340835,0.071208365,0.012035769,0.061067853,0.066068016,0.0689125,0.09192721,0.06255322,0.040259823,0.08491817,0.09229458,0.080990136,0.059271194,0.113121465,0.011982285,0.16798487,0.1331096,0.07460521,0.11783923,0.3679921]},{"chunk":{"file_path":"docs\\05_INDUSTRIAL_CHECKSUMS.md","chunk_index":395,"start_line":16,"end_line":30,"content":"<span style=\"background: #0284c7; color: #ffffff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 12px;\">Zero Heap Allocation</span>\n<span style=\"background: #059669; color: #ffffff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 12px;\">ReadOnlySpan&lt;byte&gt;</span>\n<span style=\"background: #6366f1; color: #ffffff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 12px;\">Pre-computed LUT O(1)</span>\n<span style=\"background: #d97706; color: #ffffff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 12px;\">SIMD Vectorization</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Key Architecture Principles (Cards) -->\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 28px;\">\n<div style=\"background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; border-top: 3px solid #0284c7;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #0369a1; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px;\">🚀 Zero-GC Hotpath</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;\">All computation, validation, and appending APIs execute on stack-allocated spans with zero GC allocations.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; border-top: 3px solid #059669;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #047857; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px;\">⚡ Pre-computed LUT</div>","score":0.0},"vector":[0.09384149,0.005905627,0.013215547,0.17123081,0.16360201,0.06573469,0.016900463,0.17711258,0.007924709,0.39981982,0.03779601,0.013498575,0.16691568,0.022127675,0.14624439,0.10288932,0.02179817,0.28670174,0.0,0.050181575,0.01240547,0.18459575,0.05372161,0.027388524,0.004784305,0.05106877,0.10392591,0.015837736,0.0,0.046214383,0.16664296,0.042891137,0.032338265,0.0139985215,0.19052517,0.048667915,0.3320353,0.033877734,0.02206316,0.15196061,0.16093409,0.056870993,0.01357502,0.13860363,0.08875863,0.012285661,0.116391435,0.008261423,0.19819395,0.00867323,0.162889,0.042352714,0.007874168,0.16902967,0.0283841,0.029781206,0.018845946,0.15075809,0.12052724,0.0439154,0.0,0.13094638,0.099603,0.31450388]},{"chunk":{"file_path":"docs\\05_INDUSTRIAL_CHECKSUMS.md","chunk_index":396,"start_line":31,"end_line":45,"content":"<div style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;\">Leverages 256-entry static lookup tables (<code>static readonly ushort[]</code>) to reduce shift operations into O(1) table references.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; border-top: 3px solid #d97706;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #b45309; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px;\">🔧 In-Place Packet Framing</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;\">Writes checksums directly to the end of the transmit buffer without intermediate memory copies.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Section 1: Specifications Matrix Table -->\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 14px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n<span style=\"background: #0284c7; width: 6px; height: 20px; bord