e-height: 1.6;\">\nIsolates periodic telemetry, command console traffic, and spontaneous alarms to <strong>completely eliminate UI freezing and guarantee regulatory compliance (Audit Trail)</strong>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 18px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;\">","score":0.0},"vector":[0.0796668,0.004073447,0.24448623,0.12251491,0.3651786,0.038577244,0.0041732863,0.17333545,0.11851916,0.27072385,0.0,0.0089615835,0.1015872,0.17468554,0.036505397,0.057180896,0.024303345,0.21954046,0.063092574,0.07723985,0.029688785,0.15557297,0.05514019,0.12508985,0.01256198,0.14185052,0.06464134,0.089616135,0.0,0.15534957,0.17147733,0.088544205,0.08636567,0.047569916,0.22109555,0.027611362,0.19067983,0.1066212,0.14810875,0.08778206,0.0680068,0.122868866,0.05922197,0.15104088,0.023330532,0.048928183,0.03126257,0.06361993,0.066996925,0.19446823,0.13499133,0.0684127,0.0,0.10116626,0.007534074,0.08374225,0.06118221,0.12371525,0.01216092,0.20009364,0.02609745,0.072858915,0.03781714,0.29121745]},{"chunk":{"file_path":"docs\\03_OBSERVABILITY_LOGGING.md","chunk_index":723,"start_line":16,"end_line":30,"content":"<span style=\"background: #4f46e5; color: #ffffff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 12px;\">DropOldest Ringbuffer</span>\n<span style=\"background: #059669; color: #ffffff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 12px;\">60 FPS UI Guaranteed</span>\n<span style=\"background: #0284c7; color: #ffffff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 12px;\">Zero Disk I/O in Hotpath</span>\n<span style=\"background: #d97706; color: #ffffff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 12px;\">FDA 21 CFR Part 11 Audit Trail</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- 3-Pillar Architecture Grid -->\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 28px;\">\n<div style=\"background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; border-top: 3px solid #0284c7;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #0369a1; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px;\">⚡ Core Engine (Kable)</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;\">Focuses exclusively on 0-GC packet routing; disk I/O and DB insertions are 100% excluded from the core pipeline.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; border-top: 3px solid #059669;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #047857; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px;\">📁 Injected Loggers (Serilog)</div>","score":0.0},"vector":[0.06456011,0.012188829,0.01632089,0.16762827,0.18632682,0.008055225,0.00780085,0.16436553,0.007498877,0.39125752,0.0,0.0,0.13995202,0.02360222,0.14367889,0.09660592,0.037591822,0.2795175,0.010820348,0.060544424,0.011682152,0.16962661,0.04981125,0.025894932,0.004546508,0.075983346,0.06437782,0.019071933,0.0,0.062372696,0.16469811,0.028818872,0.10213904,0.013723717,0.23137988,0.011144071,0.32259575,0.033253074,0.051434275,0.14884613,0.16201383,0.05432454,0.046146642,0.16319525,0.07214429,0.003650644,0.11477854,0.014712096,0.20260487,0.020507587,0.17146935,0.046095397,0.016286721,0.15300047,0.03994738,0.024918096,0.005881593,0.16857634,0.16528243,0.049475327,0.003686969,0.13195284,0.052549794,0.31071696]},{"chunk":{"file_path":"docs\\03_OBSERVABILITY_LOGGING.md","chunk_index":724,"start_line":31,"end_line":45,"content":"<div style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;\">Lossless regulatory compliance archival is handled asynchronously by background workers via daily rolling files.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; border-top: 3px solid #4f46e5;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #4338ca; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px;\">🖥️ UI Monitoring (WPF/Web)</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;\">Enforces <code>BoundedChannelFullMode.DropOldest</code> to guarantee stutter-free 60 FPS rendering even under 100Hz streaming.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Traffic Channels Comparison Table -->\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 14px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n<span style=\"background: #4f46e5; width: 6px; height: 20px; border-radius: 3px; display: inline-block;\"></span>\n1. Tri-Channel Traffic Classification (TrafficKind)\n</h2>\n","score":0.0},"vector":[0.06524028,0.0052938284,0.0886286,0.1704523,0.14593199,0.05561101,0.0,0.14620444,0.040408377,0.29085666,0.005229661,0.006034224,0.11793396,0.07621587,0.1059214,0.040534124,0.07539485,0.36553368,0.01969338,0.01780375,0.011704011,0.12865514,0.058538463,0.0873171,0.008459745,0.06847257,0.036879107,0.0558756,0.0,0.06052517,0.091697164,0.04374945,0.06698175,0.021046193,0.15280165,0.0,0.030903697,0.06204055,0.033125076,0.10842658,0.10530071,0.078620255,0.086933024,0.25520515,0.09995918,0.02270438,0.14481845,0.029969977,0.019901095,0.020081172,0.17838693,0.1283191,0.063486196,0.1750837,0.0074387407,0.113591276,0.0,0.19780692,0.03251868,0.10929296,0.07922313,0.049109213,0.08288277,0.52010465]},{"chunk":{"file_path":"docs\\03_OBSERVABILITY_LOGGING.md","chunk_index":725,"start_line":46,"end_line":60,"content":"<div style=\"overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: left; font-size: 13px;\">\n<thead>\n<tr style=\"background: #f1f5f9; color: #334155; border-bottom: 2px solid #cbd5e1;\">\n<th style=\"padding: 12px 14px; font-weight: 700;\">Classification (Kind)</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 12px 14px; font-weight: 700;\">Traffic Nature</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 12px 14px; font-weight: 700;\">Buffer Policy</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 12px 14px; font-weight: 700;\">Primary Binding Target</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; background: #ffffff;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #0284c7;\">AperiodicCommand</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 14px; color: #334155;\">Sequence execution, servo control, user-triggered transaction queries & replies</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 14px; color: #475569;\"><span style=\"background:#e0f2fe; color:#0369a1; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px; font-size:11.5px; font-weight:600;\">Lossless Archival</span></td>","score":0.0},"vector":[0.12079559,0.037023578,0.0063139163,0.12546624,0.17196412,0.048284672,0.015672043,0.20523709,0.07047769,0.34604645,0.114824824,0.0,0.15704647,0.0,0.08972066,0.0063596694,0.07083007,0.38439053,0.025812775,0.16027716,0.11810312,0.14716102,0.0974716,0.05814711,0.01461761,0.04829319,0.0638356,0.09272141,0.012448715,0.024685383,0.037578244,0.0,0.01090229,0.01319751,0.113164425,0.0,0.09320308,0.07762867,0.011324314,0.09143842,0.07376108,0.14713767,0.10152248,0.2498438,0.13276298,0.04281143,0.031159345,0.05015054,0.20488842,0.0,0.25139657,0.12442874,0.045942694,0.105027124,0.0,0.0,0.0,0.2516179,0.15144283,0.09208021,0.0,0.02507527,0.08931485,0.28656968]},{"chunk":{"file_path":"docs\\03_OBSERVABILITY_LOGGING.md","chunk_index":726,"start_line":61,"end_line":75,"content":"<td style=\"padding: 12px 14px; color: #334155;\">HMI Command Console, Audit Trail logs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; background: #f8fafc;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #059669;\">PeriodicTelemetry</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 14px; color: #334155;\">10~100Hz high-speed sensors, temperature/pressure polling, heartbeat ping-pong</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 14px; color: #475569;\"><span style=\"background:#dcfce7; color:#15803d; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px; font-size:11.5px; font-weight:600;\">DropOldest Ringbuffer</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 14px; color: #334155;\">Real-time charts, gauges, trend visualizations</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background: #ffffff;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #dc2626;\">SpontaneousAlarm</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 14px; color: #334155;\">Device unsolicited faults, safety interlock trips, emergency stops (E-STOP)</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 14px; color: #475569;\"><span style=\"background:#fee2e2; color:#b91c1c; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:4px; font-size:11.5px; font-weight:600;\">Priority Lossless Queue</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 12px 14px; color: #334155;\">Alarm popup dialogs, fault history database</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>","score":0.0},"vector":[0.041224074,0.050969895,0.017766248,0.2202813,0.08032273,0.0,0.037206616,0.17670631,0.013008726,0.39506721,0.01198159,0.007856811,0.13957232,0.0,0.07529426,0.053035606,0.014206144,0.327474,0.0,0.12866001,0.41167328,0.16769668,0.23156919,0.063357785,0.013177671,0.06351857,0.023319047,0.13132007,0.01123454,0.04150089,0.11378233,0.015541628,0.13409868,0.0065857642,0.07644817,0.0065294765,0.07960045,0.10671287,0.0,0.07345124,0.09010707,0.045864955,0.023794709,0.15289626,0.012016106,0.047746796,0.037282113,0.011936699,0.0761298,0.025967969,0.09171867,0.043394364,0.050403755,0.088135816,0.04387552,0.058357194,0.0,0.28906095,0.025887538,0.1237594,0.013286065,0.009316447,0.17431277,0.24366587]},{"chunk":{"file_path":"docs\\03_OBSERVABILITY_LOGGING.md","chunk_index":727,"start_line":76,"end_line":90,"content":"</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Section 2: Code Specification -->\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 14px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n<span style=\"background: #4f46e5; width: 6px; height: 20px; border-radius: 3px; display: inline-block;\"></span>\n2. ICommObserver Core Interface Specification\n</h2>\n\n```csharp\nnamespace Kable.Observability;\n\nusing System;","score":0.0},"vector":[0.081742726,0.0,0.109783255,0.08125329,0.2567831,0.030524082,0.0,0.21873024,0.12038736,0.28258622,0.0,0.02453897,0.06586776,0.073996685,0.05528187,0.1182053,0.12514874,0.37358013,0.045190338,0.094876185,0.04588105,0.11772296,0.042423304,0.09947721,0.0,0.037923865,0.0,0.19413766,0.07028281,0.11124334,0.041579917,0.0,0.07295206,0.0,0.33714944,0.0,0.083159834,0.06565962,0.041032378,0.10539599,0.04469598,0.05108112,0.284697,0.105374165,0.10665095,0.040370565,0.0,0.0,0.048134133,0.18871768,0.064437635,0.071107246,0.0,0.07151357,0.0,0.0,0.0,0.117745586,0.06257437,0.0,0.0,0.039108984,0.0,0.40214342]},{"chunk":{"file_path":"docs\\03_OBSERVABILITY_LOGGING.md","chunk_index":728,"start_line":91,"end_line":105,"content":"using System.Threading.Channels;\n\npublic interface ICommObserver\n{\n    // [Engine -> Observer 0-GC Fast Dispatch] Non-blocking return on the hotpath\n    void OnPacketTrace(in PacketTraceRecord trace);\n\n    // [UI Dedicated Decoupled Channels with DropOldest Ringbuffers]\n    ChannelReader<PacketTraceRecord> PeriodicStream { get; }  // Binds to real-time charts/gauges\n    ChannelReader<PacketTraceRecord> CommandStream  { get; }  // Binds to command console\n    ChannelReader<PacketTraceRecord> AlarmStream    { get; }  // Binds to alert popups and history\n}\n```\n\n</div>","score":0.0},"vector":[0.40219906,0.093244895,0.13061197,0.0,0.2766251,0.0,0.10642538,0.06018102,0.121406846,0.050552055,0.0,0.07434125,0.0,0.14776756,0.081012905,0.049670935,0.10864256,0.015997486,0.0,0.11025658,0.016850686,0.35863844,0.09027153,0.020060338,0.03240516,0.0,0.11857916,0.0,0.04076779,0.13518682,0.0,0.075150184,0.0,0.0,0.35116363,0.01780002,0.0,0.16355076,0.057445515,0.018862706,0.08947968,0.083053425,0.033257928,0.021420363,0.03240516,0.034156792,0.0,0.19756599,0.10719743,0.0,0.0,0.0,0.21435687,0.08486125,0.17545219,0.0,0.0,0.0,0.1331193,0.11203082,0.22779186,0.10531678,0.13643311,0.21426393]},{"chunk":{"file_path":"docs\\03_OBSERVABILITY_LOGGING.md","chunk_index":729,"start_line":106,"end_line":115,"content":"\n<!-- Note Box -->\n<div style=\"background: #f0f9ff; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; padding: 14px 18px; margin-top: 24px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #0369a1; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 4px;\">💡 Practical Architecture Tip</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: #334155; line-height: 1.6;\">\nIn single-threaded UI runtimes like WPF or WinForms, piping high-frequency telemetry directly into a console UI freezes the dispatcher loop. Kable's <code>ICommObserver</code> isolates <strong>PeriodicStream (DropOldest)</strong> from <strong>CommandStream (Lossless)</strong>, permanently guaranteeing smooth 60 FPS UI rendering.\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>","score":0.0},"vector":[0.12575172,0.0,0.16828096,0.19634837,0.36305377,0.01213438,0.0,0.09566549,0.13449216,0.29495797,0.02543834,0.0,0.079784326,0.037066698,0.08139846,0.06560209,0.027288787,0.3094932,0.061212346,0.12949128,0.0,0.048450895,0.04436963,0.04905902,0.021544717,0.087181926,0.0,0.053282306,0.011351517,0.10848068,0.08533847,0.2238936,0.19466758,0.026726358,0.15860265,0.0,0.06090526,0.07598288,0.11348549,0.12682933,0.10069343,0.09170098,0.018851629,0.11556905,0.009866272,0.10351062,0.019732544,0.023202002,0.035345756,0.025748562,0.19958712,0.08707237,0.0,0.2535906,0.03771407,0.030162606,0.012275478,0.19182795,0.09094733,0.12996183,0.023459803,0.013534501,0.05689764,0.3457769]},{"chunk":{"file_path":"src\\Kable.SharedMemory\\Waveform\\SharedMemoryWaveformBuffer.cs","chunk_index":730,"start_line":1,"end_line":15,"content":"namespace Kable.SharedMemory.Waveform;\n\nusing System;\nusing System.IO.MemoryMappedFiles;\nusing System.Runtime.CompilerServices;\nusing System.Runtime.InteropServices;\nusing System.Threading;\n\n/// <summary>\n/// 고주파 아날로그 파형 및 계측 텔레메트리를 위한 슬롯 구조체 (샘플 타임스탬프, 채널 ID, 값)\n/// </summary>\n[StructLayout(LayoutKind.Sequential, Pack = 8)]\npublic struct WaveformSample\n{\n    public long TimestampTicks;","score":0.0},"vector":[0.3644667,0.049037598,0.17157724,0.048257645,0.19276847,0