ody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>","score":0.0},"vector":[0.023468474,0.0,0.007358759,0.13799341,0.14921743,0.0,0.01046185,0.17364812,0.055169884,0.42825058,0.00700269,0.013783072,0.15548691,0.0,0.15352516,0.0,0.028128315,0.34240264,0.046006184,0.12099066,0.349252,0.09587374,0.26947317,0.0,0.0,0.0,0.017026147,0.014472227,0.019734854,0.039551426,0.069977,0.039281756,0.031011915,0.027566144,0.13620628,0.0,0.18462086,0.054981448,0.0,0.098844714,0.13717276,0.07458763,0.0,0.160945,0.0,0.0,0.05213113,0.009438408,0.05565461,0.021178866,0.06715869,0.0,0.04933263,0.06120772,0.07686713,0.0,0.0,0.36238143,0.06684533,0.042877764,0.0074216546,0.017026149,0.11572012,0.2327728]},{"chunk":{"file_path":"docs\\README.md","chunk_index":817,"start_line":1,"end_line":15,"content":"<div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 100%; margin: 0 auto;\">\n\n<!-- Hero Header Banner -->\n<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 50%, #1d4ed8 100%); border-radius: 14px; padding: 36px 30px; margin-bottom: 30px; color: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.25);\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.18); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4); padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: #38bdf8; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<span>🔌 INDUSTRIAL HARDWARE COMMUNICATION ENGINE</span>\n</div>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; color: #ffffff; border-bottom: none; padding-bottom: 0;\">\n      Kable Documentation\n</h1>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #94a3b8; max-width: 780px; line-height: 1.6;\">\n      A high-performance, zero-allocation reactive hardware communication engine combining Microsoft Bedrock's <code>System.IO.Pipelines</code> transport abstraction with RSocket interaction patterns.\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 20px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;\">\n<span style=\"background: #2563eb; color: #ffffff; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 12px;\">.NET 10.0 / 8.0 / netstandard2.0</span>","score":0.0},"vector":[0.09249627,0.0,0.25264093,0.11322097,0.357806,0.048584342,0.010148265,0.28670433,0.12006786,0.29899538,0.02050736,0.016851027,0.15262392,0.10902989,0.047165964,0.016621914,0.024937453,0.26327717,0.06254035,0.042687275,0.013073413,0.13621572,0.042978972,0.063850865,0.008299816,0.12093054,0.072399676,0.10643631,0.0065650195,0.046147116,0.12213043,0.086883195,0.084719285,0.04720459,0.22332364,0.028770298,0.20854121,0.03275896,0.14125939,0.10505318,0.07046373,0.12253625,0.0778832,0.13909459,0.074910924,0.0980156,0.016163923,0.06483738,0.08165563,0.08278529,0.12467438,0.05789709,0.022145053,0.09296863,0.049769334,0.08069896,0.06584309,0.14623186,0.038931184,0.12439696,0.007813974,0.04843734,0.049038332,0.32386753]},{"chunk":{"file_path":"docs\\README.md","chunk_index":818,"start_line":16,"end_line":30,"content":"<span style=\"background: #059669; color: #ffffff; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 12px;\">0-GC Pipelines I/O</span>\n<span style=\"background: #7c3aed; color: #ffffff; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 12px;\">Fail-Fast Safe-State</span>\n<span style=\"background: #d97706; color: #ffffff; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 12px;\">Tri-Stream Observability</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Feature Grid Cards -->\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 32px;\">\n<div style=\"background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.03); border-top: 3px solid #2563eb;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #1d4ed8; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">⚡ Bedrock Pipelines Zero-Copy</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;\">\n        Eliminates socket and serial memory buffer copying using <code>ReadOnlySequence&lt;byte&gt;</code> vector-accelerated framing with allocation budgets under 1KB/request.\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.03); border-top: 3px solid #059669;\">","score":0.0},"vector":[0.03362689,0.021593098,0.08015614,0.1640462,0.29290363,0.023479398,0.039513025,0.15841745,0.0136739295,0.32984543,0.012765096,0.089932084,0.18125577,0.01632987,0.12942933,0.059823215,0.053595748,0.2632475,0.022960104,0.060387205,0.019483982,0.12578464,0.017758664,0.032964494,0.0,0.1595307,0.09154728,0.014141089,0.012157854,0.039939184,0.1445096,0.0362867,0.11348451,0.023589864,0.17114948,0.014500191,0.24583715,0.018583648,0.05766815,0.12714706,0.14914216,0.084780514,0.054709915,0.15060301,0.071981795,0.009083454,0.10696252,0.008407026,0.20422632,0.037802428,0.27257204,0.050938416,0.018043859,0.17711249,0.008589788,0.016174922,0.041027166,0.15889823,0.039613124,0.16396226,0.0073172264,0.044216778,0.08027788,0.34419313]},{"chunk":{"file_path":"docs\\README.md","chunk_index":819,"start_line":31,"end_line":45,"content":"<div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #047857; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">🔀 Hybrid Transaction Router</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;\">\n        Legacy ASCII/Serial instruments without correlation tokens are serialized via an asynchronous FIFO lock, while modern protocols execute lock-free multiplexing.\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.03); border-top: 3px solid #dc2626;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #b91c1c; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">🛡️ Fail-Fast Safety Policy</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;\">\n        Dispatches <code>DeviceDisconnectedException</code> immediately upon physical link drop without dangerous retries, transitioning hardware to an instant safe-state.\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.03); border-top: 3px solid #7c3aed;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: 700; color: #6d28d9; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">📊 Tri-Stream Observability</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;\">\n        Isolates periodic telemetry, command consoles, and spontaneous alarms into independent bounded ringbuffers (<code>DropOldest</code>) to prevent UI lag.","score":0.0},"vector":[0.05092938,0.024043761,0.13415731,0.18606561,0.29859442,0.015702048,0.0,0.11977257,0.026048053,0.36634234,0.015388008,0.045862112,0.11773088,0.026975708,0.08524083,0.019478424,0.04730946,0.3969935,0.07846462,0.076763466,0.012654782,0.07348657,0.060829315,0.0975496,0.040743053,0.011232123,0.047677588,0.08085831,0.032830495,0.046740215,0.07995721,0.06376307,0.06748815,0.010468033,0.22043432,0.0054567405,0.080941945,0.031116739,0.06265093,0.12558602,0.041431244,0.078295015,0.04121417,0.15957229,0.06957959,0.010612419,0.075364634,0.0,0.081209935,0.07665761,0.11315437,0.10805564,0.05873747,0.25290677,0.013040685,0.06509695,0.10672732,0.1696643,0.04941222,0.07071975,0.059746988,0.035857275,0.124845885,0.40377748]},{"chunk":{"file_path":"docs\\README.md","chunk_index":820,"start_line":46,"end_line":60,"content":"</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Quick Start Header -->\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 16px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n<span style=\"background: #2563eb; width: 6px; height: 22px; border-radius: 3px; display: inline-block;\"></span>\n    🚀 Developer Quick Start\n</h2>\n\n<!-- Step 1: NuGet -->\n<div style=\"background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 18px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<div style=\"background: #f8fafc; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 10px 18px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: #1e293b;\">\n      Step 1. Package Installation (NuGet)\n</div>","score":0.0},"vector":[0.09661865,0.02457923,0.13689865,0.098434776,0.29676345,0.029777553,0.0691098,0.19136874,0.12555173,0.27122635,0.024814628,0.023160318,0.086193234,0.019300265,0.1741209,0.017969212,0.02452269,0.3585677,0.042217355,0.06356547,0.08087947,0.12825976,0.03932884,0.048325665,0.0,0.034740478,0.014276909,0.06959403,0.0,0.07076538,0.03852271,0.0,0.06523779,0.0,0.251707,0.123196535,0.07704542,0.025224607,0.079042554,0.15678541,0.110868745,0.21837044,0.16795747,0.086528756,0.11702817,0.0,0.012261345,0.0,0.2306855,0.06568578,0.13793048,0.1168394,0.019300265,0.11737942,0.0,0.050134,0.0,0.042785645,0.0,0.010422143,0.0,0.035938423,0.0,0.4335051]},{"chunk":{"file_path":"docs\\README.md","chunk_index":821,"start_line":61,"end_line":75,"content":"<div style=\"padding: 14px 18px;\">\n\n```bash\n# Core communication engine (TCP, Serial, NamedPipe, Codecs, Builder)\ndotnet add package Kable\n\n# Pure abstraction contracts and interfaces only\ndotnet add package Kable.Core\n```\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Step 2: Fluent Builder -->\n<div style=\"background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 18px; overflow: hidden;\">","score":0.0},"vector":[0.26328433,0.0,0.0,0.0,0.06902748,0.0,0.12332199,0.20130686,0.0,0.123895586,0.08879183,0.0,0.05699197,0.0,0.08087095,0.034751195,0.07384341,0.3412998,0.07498942,0.13077074,0.048586503,0.043839976,0.0,0.04253132,0.0,0.0,0.058489297,0.16896658,0.027399985,0.25140718,0.0,0.0,0.14345749,0.044524975,0.08770071,0.09826201,0.06784759,0.16139257,0.1485753,0.296301,0.049992956,0.09291826,0.114313915,0.23241223,0.07306662,0.049131006,0.020354275,0.0,0.049131006,0.0,0.09353,0.046714727,0.19198899,0.19991328,0.16804111,0.0,0.0,0.21401049,0.11398394,0.0,0.0,0.0,0.053766005,0.37731913]},{"chunk":{"file_path":"docs\\README.md","chunk_index":822,"start_line":76,"end_line":90,"content":"<div style=\"background: #f8fafc; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 10px 18px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: #1e293b;\">\n      Step 2. Fluent Builder Connection (`KableClientBuilder`)\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; margin: 0 0 10px 0;\">\n        Configure transport layer and protocol codec cleanly in 3 lines:\n</p>\n\n```csharp\nusing Kable.Extensions;\nusing Kable.Codecs;\nusing Kable.Exceptions;\n\n// 1. Build session instance\nawait using var session = new KableClientBuilder<string>()","score":0.0},"vector":[0.20949934,0.013159495,0.23064016,0.13212366,0.23742217,0.0,0.05118104,0.23446164,0.06375309,0.34114987,0.0,0.0,0.086727336,0.041314833,0.14563175,0.0642489,0.012451995,0.3860629,0.0,0.1305468,0.02895089,0.11455836,0.0,0.14476496,0.036188614,0.0,0.050802086,0.0,0.05517583,0.23318245,0.030495465,0.0,0.14789876,0.014296736,0.096140884,0.038053654,0.04135841,0.14691451,0.0,0.17710201,0.122059084,0.08613163,0.09784795,0.17252813,0.05263798,0.0,0.033566248,0.0,0.0,0.0,0.09650297,0.08578041,0.028632749,0.14003578,0.02969322,0.058974903,0.05179619,0.26597488,0.048251487,0.034059867,0.0,0.024379697,0.08116783,0.27271023]},{"chunk":{"file_path":"docs\\README.md","chunk_index":823,"start_line":91,"end_line":105,"content":"    .UseTcp(\"192.168.0.100\", 9000)\n    // .UseSerialPort(\"COM3\", baudRate: 115200)\n    // .UseNamedPipe(\"efem_ipc_pipe\")\n    .UseCodec(new AsciiLineCodec(delimiter: 0x0A)) // Delimited by LF\n    .Build();\n\n// 2. Start asynchronous I/O pipeline\nawait session.StartAsync();\n\n// 3. Request-Response RPC with 3-second watchdog deadline\nstring response = await session.RequestAsync<string>(\"READ:TEMP\", TimeSpan.FromSeconds(3));\nConsole.WriteLine($\"Temperature response: {response}\");\n\n// 4. Ingest real-time asynchronous telemetry stream\nawait foreach (var packet in session.Stream)","score":0.0},"vector":[0.11233555,0.036994774,0.15086609,0.08784473,0.29715827,0.10123206,0.2358771,0.04673024,0.047564704,0.039755575,0.0,0.019877788,0.08878746,0.03170981,0.0,0.21392778,0.09738268,0.0,0.023782352,0.09150927,0.020178968,0.0,0.031576347,0.09363969,0.0,0.08592335,0.305612,0.0,0.21323267,0.3343593,0.09817844,0.14756967,0.0,0.07913494,0.06341962,0.04592454,0.098200366,0.19682461,0.0,0.06254714,0.19558077,0.21808794,0.20045376,0.05570977,0.06659059,0.078341864,0.015668374,0.18831174,0.092372045,0.1210738,0.03209185,0.0,0.10368602,0.0,0.0885505,0.07398955,0.16458519,0.10926629,0.0754287,0.22015336,0.049326364,0.14225744,0.13282202,0.019025885]},{"chunk":{"file_path":"docs\\README.md","chunk_index":824,"start_line":106,"end_line":120,"content":"{\n    Console.WriteLine($\"Telemetry packet: {packet}\");\n}\n```\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Step 3: KableSimple Facade -->\n<div style=\"background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 18px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<div style=\"background: #f8fafc; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 10px 18px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: #1e293b;\">\n      Step 3. Lightweight Facade (`KableSimple`)\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; margin: 0 0 10px 0;\">","score":0.0},"vector":[0.14614129,0.051954184,0.104279704,0.058691762,0.38881442,0.0,0.0,0.1633494,0.016208133,0.18843943,0.047543854,0.0,0.03565789,0.0,0.28512844,0.0539363,0.046510287,0.3381372,0.01550343,0.030790119,0.07935802,0.114029095,0.0,0.11636884,0.0,0.0,0.03146284,0.0,0.0,0.3152437,0.0,0.10390837,0.111851394,0.10187969,0.12959696,0.0,0.026091136,0.15687229,0.0,0.10540527,0.10849524,0.04872174,0.04760072,0.08371232,0.0,0.0,0.11433779,0.0,0.06292568,0.0,0.15793654,0.09744348,0.0,0.07310811,0.0,0.0,0.0,0.101804525,0.013045568,0.16572529,0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4519265]},{"chunk":{"file_path":"docs\\README.md","chunk_index":825,"start_line":121,"end_line":135,"content":"        Minimal ceremony for quick diagnostics, hardware prototypes, and sequence tests:\n</p>\n\n```csharp\nusing Kable.Simple;\n\n// Open connection and guarantee non-blocking disposal\nawait using var client = await KableSimple.OpenTcpAsync(\"192.168.0.100\", 9000);\n\n// Subscribe to real-time events & errors\nclient.LineReceived += line => Console.WriteLine($\"[Rx] {line}\");\nclient.ErrorOccurred += ex => Console.Error.WriteLine($\"[Error] {ex.Message}\");\n\n// Send command or query\nawait client.SendLineAsync(\"SERVO:ENABLE\");","score":0.0},"vector":[0.22263107,0.06252426,0.123820946,0.030287253,0.14110298,0.14945625,0.061872534,0.0,0.0,0.06663196,0.090918645,0.06663196,0.04168568,0.09307789,0.06345901,0.171351,0.14807816,0.0,0.0,0.31367204,0.032503393,0.08307361,0.11114319,0.0,0.03506945,0.0,0.0,0.25323838,0.06689173,0.30039617,0.08337136,0.105231814,0.0,0.20802148,0.13490275,0.115881674,0.0,0.3234479,0.0,0.13861765,0.10198769,0.057940837,0.0,0.0,0.20114878,0.0,0.13391717,0.25285974,0.0,0.14521171,0.053305566,0.03732225,0.0,0.1214833,0.0,0.065006785,0.0337377,0.097231604,0.024678502,0.13223922,0.24226409,0.08620218,0.15471582,0.08163488]},{"chunk":{"file_path":"docs\\README.md","chunk_index":826,"start_line":136,"end_line":150,"content":"string status = await client.QueryAsync(\"SERVO:STATUS?\");\n```\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Step 4: DI Container -->\n<div style=\"background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 30px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<div style=\"background: #f8fafc; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 10px 18px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: #1e293b;\">\n      Step 4. Dependency Injection (`Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection`)\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 14px 18px;\">\n\n```csharp\n// 1. Register observability and multi-channel ringbuffers","sco